@page "/tiers"
@using RavenNest.Blazor.Services
@using RavenNest.BusinessLogic

@*
    Public on purpose. The landing page invites you to see what the tiers unlock, and the only page
    that answered was the dashboard one, which needs an account: the people most likely to ask are
    the ones who have not made one yet.

    Everything here comes from PatreonTiers, which is written from the code that grants these
    rather than from the copy that advertised them. The two had drifted.
*@

<div class="top-section">
    <div class="hero-text">
        <h1>Patreon tiers</h1>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="white-section-break"></div>

<div class="page-content">
    <div class="section">
        <p class="rf-lead">
            Ravenfall is free to play and always will be. Supporting it on Patreon keeps the
            servers running, and the tiers below are what that gives you and the viewers on your
            stream.
        </p>

        <div class="rf-tiers">
            @foreach (var tier in PatreonTiers.All)
            {
                <div class="rf-tier @(tier.Tier == 3 ? "rf-tier--pick" : "")">
                    @if (tier.Tier == 3)
                    {
                        <span class="rf-tier__flag">Most popular</span>
                    }
                    <h2 class="rf-tier__name">@tier.Name</h2>
                    <p class="rf-tier__multi">@tier.ExpMultiplier&times;<span> experience</span></p>

                    <ul class="rf-perks">
                        <li class="rf-perk">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-check" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                            <span><b>@tier.ExpMultiplier&times; experience</b> for your characters.</span>
                        </li>

                        @if (tier.VillageHouses > 0)
                        {
                            <li class="rf-perk">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-check" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                <span>
                                    <b>At least @tier.VillageHouses town plots</b>, whatever your
                                    town level.
                                </span>
                            </li>
                        }
                        else
                        {
                            <li class="rf-perk rf-perk--absent">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-minus" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                <span>Town plots come from your town level only.</span>
                            </li>
                        }

                        @if (tier.Chatbot)
                        {
                            <li class="rf-perk">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-check" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                <span>
                                    <b>Chatbot features</b>, which translate what the bot says and
                                    let it phrase replies to each player.
                                </span>
                            </li>
                        }
                        else
                        {
                            <li class="rf-perk rf-perk--absent">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-minus" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                <span>Chatbot features need Dragon or above.</span>
                            </li>
                        }
                    </ul>
                </div>
            }
        </div>

        <div class="rf-actions rf-actions--centred">
            <RavenLink Href="https://www.patreon.com/ravenfall"><i class="fab fa-patreon"></i>&nbsp;Support Ravenfall</RavenLink>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <h1>Every tier includes</h1>
        <div class="rf-calc">
            <ul class="rf-perks">
                @foreach (var perk in PatreonTiers.SharedPerks)
                {
                    <li class="rf-perk">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-check" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        <span>@perk</span>
                    </li>
                }
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <h1>The details</h1>
        <div class="rf-calc">
            <dl class="rf-facts">
                <dt>How the experience multiplier works</dt>
                <dd>
                    It applies to your own characters, and you get the higher of your Patreon tier
                    and your Twitch subscription tier rather than both added together.
                </dd>

                <dt>What a town plot is</dt>
                <dd>
                    A plot in your town that a viewer lives on, boosting one skill for everyone
                    playing on your stream. A town earns them one per ten town levels up to
                    @PatreonTiers.MaxVillageHouses, and a tier is a floor rather than an addition:
                    it guarantees you that many however low your town level is, and a town that has
                    levelled past them keeps what it earned.
                </dd>

                <dt>Is anything pay to win</dt>
                <dd>
                    The experience multiplier is real and it is the reason the tiers exist. Nothing
                    a tier gives is unavailable otherwise: town plots are earned by levelling and
                    the highscores are shared by everyone.
                </dd>

                <dt>Already a patron</dt>
                <dd>
                    Your <a href="/patreon">Patreon page</a> shows the tier you are on now and lets
                    you link or unlink your account.
                </dd>
            </dl>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
